# Full finite translation of tests/ownership-corpus/580-all-futures.ok
# Plain arithmetic, Events and TAP plumbing omitted; schedule explicit.
profile own
scope.begin main async
scope.begin block
future first new A bound
future second new B bound
collect.all results first second first
assert.items results @result:first @result:second @result:first
get a results 0
get duplicate results 2
use a
